        },
        {
            "summary": "Model for international best practices in sustainable land use.",
            "explanation": "The integrated approach developed within this community serves as an international model for how renewable energy projects can deliver broader ecological benefits. Their design and implementation may serve as reference points or blueprints for similar initiatives globally, facilitating knowledge transfer in the fields of agrovoltaics and biodiversity-oriented infrastructure [Data: Entities (44, 48); Relationships (73)]."
