    "title": "Austrian Solarindustrie and PV-Wertschöpfungskette Community",
    "summary": "The Austrian solar industry (Solarindustrie) and its integrated photovoltaic value chain (PV-Wertschöpfungskette) form a closely interconnected community driving innovation, manufacturing, deployment, and full lifecycle management of solar technologies in Austria and Europe. The Solarindustrie encompasses all major phases from research and development to international export, while the PV-Wertschöpfungskette ensures that each stage, including end-of-life recycling, is robustly addressed. These entities collectively boost Austria's role in renewable energy, position it competitively on a global scale, and promote environmentally responsible growth by overseeing the lifecycle of PV products.",
