        },
        {
            "summary": "Significance for Austria’s climate targets and international reputation",
            "explanation": "The integration of the EAG with the Photovoltaic Strategy and the support for green electricity facilities enhances Austria’s position as a leader in renewable energy transformation. The ambitious targets and policy integration boost Austria’s credibility and reputation both domestically and internationally, reflecting a national commitment to climate neutrality and sustainable development [Data: Entities (6, 8); Relationships (7, 17)]."
