        {
            "summary": "Political momentum underscored by high-level signatories such as Austria.",
            "explanation": "Austria’s signing of the Solar-Charta in April 2024 demonstrates growing political backing among EU member states. This move is indicative of widespread governmental acceptance and offers a template for other nations to follow, thereby expanding the Charter’s impact. The endorsement facilitates harmonized policy adoption and drives alignment between state actors and industry [Data: Entities (180)]."
