        {
            "summary": "Photovoltaic Applications and Hydrogen Production in the Transport Sector",
            "explanation": "The description of the Verkehrssektor highlights the importance of integrating PV applications not only for powering electric mobility directly but also for supporting hydrogen production processes. Both avenues are crucial for flexible, low-carbon transport energy solutions, with hydrogen offering longer-range and heavy-duty vehicle options complementing battery electric vehicles. These strategies fit squarely within Austria's broader sustainability ambitions and have implications for energy infrastructure investments [Data: Entities (125)]."
